<title>USA: Alma forms new subsidiary.</title>
<headline>Alma forms new subsidiary.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alma International Inc said Thursday it has formed a new subsidiary, Sports Brands USA.</p>
<p>Wholly owned by Alma, the new company will leverage Alma's marketing to provide products for &quot;aging baby boomer&quot; sports and leisure activities.</p>
</text>
